# Bomb: a task, the bomb ticking, stopping it for the next task, the settings
# (the later bound can't go below the earlier one), the rules. The blast comes
# after real seconds, so a script doesn't reach it.
#! app party
RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT 5 shot menu
5 shot task
5 shot ticking
RSOFT shot next
RSOFT DOWN 5 shot settings
DOWN 5 1 0 CENTER shot max
RSOFT DOWN 5 shot rules
